## Reading the graph

- The root is the shared game world, not a second application or service.
- Every idea has a stable ID and belongs to exactly one domain.
- Every idea connects to four other ideas through typed relationships; the graph records the reason for each edge.
- Domain links explain larger flows such as exploration → crafting → Bazaar, or Tavern → story → Vault → Archive.
- Feature documents are descriptive specifications. The graph never changes implementation status.
